@startuml
[*] --> Idle
Idle : card inserted
Idle --> PinEntry

PinEntry : pin entered
PinEntry --> ValidPin : pin correct
PinEntry --> PinEntry : pin incorrect
PinEntry --> CardRetained : incorrect pin too many times
PinEntry --> Idle : user cancels

ValidPin : pin correct
ValidPin --> OptionsDisplay

OptionsDisplay : user selects option
OptionsDisplay --> Processing

Processing --> Idle

CardRetained : timeout
CardRetained --> [*]

Idle --> [*]

@enduml
